---
layout: layout.njk
---

{% set elephantClass = "w-full h-auto" %}

<div>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <div class="mb-8 flex justify-center gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="text-brain w-24 md:w-26">{% include "elephant.njk" %}</div>

        <div class="text-culture w-24 md:w-26">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>

        <div class="text-bureaucracy w-24 md:w-26">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1>There are elephants in the meeting room.</h1>
      <p>They quietly shape conversations, decisions, and change efforts.</p>
      <p>Do you know how to put them to work?</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THREE ELEPHANTS DETAILED -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2 class="mb-12">Meet the elephants:</h2>
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-brain text-2xl"></i>
          <h3>The brains in the room</h3>
          <p>
            Brains optimize for efficiency, creating blind spots in how groups
            think and behave.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-mug-hot text-culture text-2xl"></i>
          <h3>The culture they create together</h3>
          <p>
            Cultural norms determine who feels safe speaking, what remains
            unsaid, and how people navigate each other.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-bureaucracy text-2xl"></i>
          <h3>The bureaucracy they work within</h3>
          <p>
            Organizational structures and incentives determine what's possible
            and what gets done.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONSULTING -->
  <section class="bg-accent py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2>Organifanten puts the elephants to work.</h2>
      <div class="mb-10 grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p>
            Organifanten helps you intentionally use the shortcuts of brains,
            the unwritten rules of your culture, and the gravity of your
            bureaucracy.
          </p>
          <p>
            Instead of fighting inertia, we design actions that complement and
            leverage these forces so they accelerate performance rather than
            block it.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a
              href="/consulting/"
              class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
              >More about my approach →</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/GraphicRecording.jpeg"
            alt="Graphic recording session"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-sm"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <blockquote class="border-primary mx-auto max-w-2xl border-l-4 pl-6">
        <p>
          Excellent workshops, a highly professional approach, and a very
          enjoyable collaboration. You consistently move another step forward
          while gaining both time and knowledge.
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-2 italic opacity-60">
          Jörn A. (Managing Director)
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE RESOURCES -->
  <section class="bg-accent py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 px-6">
      <h2>Some challenges don't need consulting.</h2>
      <p>
        You are the expert for your challenges. <br />Utilize the resources to
        explore, discuss, and improve your organization on your own terms.
      </p>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/resources/"
          class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
        >
          To the resources →
        </a>
      </div>
      <p>
        But if you'd like to draw on my experience, I offer consulting sessions,
        a change audit, and a culture portrait.
      </p>
      <a href="/consulting/" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
        >To the consulting services →</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</div>
